  "kind": "process",
  "title": "Track runway",
  "summary": "Track runway and burn — pull balances, read the monthly spend, and know the zero-cash date.",
  "outcomes": [],
  "guidance": null,
  "parts": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "kind": "step",
      "title": "Fetch account balances",
      "guidance": "Take a consistent-date snapshot of accounts included in runway. Separate unrestricted operating cash from restricted funds, investments and pending transfers, and state currency conversion assumptions. Reconcile it to the cash schedule and identify stale or inaccessible balances so the calculation uses funds the company can actually draw on.",
