      "id": "n2",
      "kind": "step",
      "title": "Analyze monthly spend",
      "guidance": "Analyze spending and operating receipts over comparable monthly periods, separating recurring activity, unusual purchases, financing and internal transfers. Compare the pattern with upcoming payroll, vendor commitments and collection timing. Explain where historical averages would misrepresent future cash use, then use those adjustments in the forward runway estimate.",
