    {
      "id": "n3",
      "kind": "step",
      "title": "Calculate runway",
      "guidance": "Estimate runway from available cash and explicit spending and collection assumptions. A stable positive monthly cash outflow supports a simple ratio; uneven or positive cash flow calls for a month-by-month projection. Include planned hires and commitments, compare a downside case and identify the first cash constraint so management can see which assumptions require action.",
